<h1 class="page-title">Feedra Prototype</h1>
<p class="standfirst">UX, web &amp; sound design &middot; 2025 &middot; for Pierre Proske</p>

<p>Feedra is a soundboard app for running live sound, whether it's a game master's tabletop campaign or a stage show: you build a scene's whole soundscape beforehand, then play it live. In 2025, electronic media artist and designer Pierre Proske was developing it, and wanted students' help brainstorming and prototyping ideas for its design and functionality.</p>
<p>Feedra was another collaboration with Nicholas Duncan (we'd done the sound for <a href="/sound-design/okiro/">Okiro</a> together). With Nick, I designed a website for the app's (hypothetical) promotion and distribution, and we worked out an overall look and set of conventions for the application. I also wrote thorough user documentation, and did the sound design for the demo scenes.</p>

