<h2>The prototypes</h2>
<p>We designed the prototypes in Figma, from the first wireframes to a click-through, high-fidelity version, and built an interactive, low-fidelity version in Godot, with six demo scenes to play. In it, sounds are organised into campaigns and scenes, and each scene is a board of pads: big ones that loop (ambiences and music) and small ones for one-off effects, each with its own picture, volume, fades and effects.</p>

